From c16b90bde2dc7c7bba94fd7f57dc1730037111cc Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "Jose M. Caballero Guerrero"
 <80172778+Caballero-git@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 30 Sep 2026 07:45:42 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 17/30] P25T: add the GSL3673 touchscreen firmware for
 CONFIG_EXTRA_FIRMWARE

silead_ts is built in and probes ~0.5 s into boot, before the root
filesystem is mounted, so request_firmware() finds no file ("Direct
firmware load ... failed with error -2"). Ship the firmware in the source
tree and build it into the kernel (p25t-kernel.config:
CONFIG_EXTRA_FIRMWARE="silead/gsl3673-p25t.fw",
CONFIG_EXTRA_FIRMWARE_DIR="p25t-firmware"). The firmware loader checks
built-in blobs first, so this is used even if a copy exists in
/lib/firmware.

The table is the tablet's own, extracted from its stock Android kernel
(see p25t-firmware/README).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_0156c5MfQpFxaYWNNLMrcym9
---
 p25t-firmware/README                 |  12 ++++++++++++
 p25t-firmware/silead/gsl3673-p25t.fw | Bin 0 -> 37224 bytes
 2 files changed, 12 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 p25t-firmware/README
 create mode 100644 p25t-firmware/silead/gsl3673-p25t.fw

diff --git a/p25t-firmware/README b/p25t-firmware/README
new file mode 100644
index 000000000..c088dd402
--- /dev/null
+++ b/p25t-firmware/README
@@ -0,0 +1,12 @@
+Firmware built into the Teclast P25T kernel via CONFIG_EXTRA_FIRMWARE
+(CONFIG_EXTRA_FIRMWARE_DIR="p25t-firmware", relative to the source tree).
+
+silead/gsl3673-p25t.fw
+    Silead GSL3673 touchscreen firmware. The vendor driver is compiled into
+    the tablet's stock Android kernel with this table as C data; extracted
+    from that kernel Image (the table belonging to compatible
+    "GSL,GSL3673_800X1280") with p25t-linux tools/gsl_fw_from_stock_kernel.py.
+    141 pages, 37224 bytes, sha256
+    163a2a8384b0cb550bb1e61f07bc5eee94d2aa59fa6fa9e86b656959e68e2573.
+    Built in because silead_ts is built in and probes before the root
+    filesystem (and /lib/firmware) is mounted.
diff --git a/p25t-firmware/silead/gsl3673-p25t.fw b/p25t-firmware/silead/gsl3673-p25t.fw
new file mode 100644
index 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000..9c898d839a518c378bddf6f0da7496fa5c1e2a58
GIT binary patch
